    "body": "I think the word \"fluent\" is pretty [standard](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fluent_interface) and also matches its [dictionary](https://www.dictionary.com/browse/fluent) definition, but I agree \"concise\" was probably picked arbitrarily as an alternative mode. So maybe something simpler like just `fluent = false`?",
